OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fdry through the evening. Staying dry
OL,7,Fovernight with some clear spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping and winds falling light,
OL,9,Fbut staying cloudier in the north.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FMostly dry with bright or
OL,12,Fsunny spells and light winds, chance
OL,13,Fof the odd afternoon shower.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FFurther
OL,16,Frain or showers, occasionally heavy,
OL,17,Fbut also with some drier and brighter
OL,18,Fspells at times.
